<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_module_loader">ModuleLoader</link></para>

<para>Manages asynchronous loading of non-critical modules. Critical modules (<link linkend="_class_core">Core</link>, <link linkend="_class_config">Config</link>, <link linkend="_class_lang">Lang</link>, <link linkend="_class_bins">Bins</link>) load synchronously. Non-critical modules (<link linkend="_class_apps">Apps</link>, <link linkend="_class_tools">Tools</link>, <link linkend="_class_registry">Registry</link>, <link linkend="_class_homepage">Homepage</link>) load in background. </para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8moduleloader_8php_source_1l00016">16</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8moduleloader_8php_source">class.moduleloader.php</link>.</para>
</section>
